@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:security] mila-crypto-no-secret-diagnostics
Private key bytes, signatures and derived authentication tokens MUST NOT be logged or formatted by production APIs.

@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:verification] mila-crypto-hegel-properties
Hegel properties MUST cover `DeviceKey::from_seed` against an independent
P-256 scalar-range oracle, the `sign`/`verify` and `verify_public_key` round
trip with message binding, and verification totality over arbitrary and
corrupted signature and point bytes with its typed refusals. SHA-256 is a
direct library wrapper and has no property.
